flowchart TD
    P[Publisher enters headline and article] --> L[Local JSON article file]
    P --> C[Text cleaning and normalization]
    C --> N[TF-IDF + Logistic Regression baseline]
    N --> Q[Fake-class score]
    Q --> RL[One-step tabular Q-learning policy]
    RL --> D{FAKE / REAL / REVIEW recommendation}
    P --> H[SHA-256 hashes: content and full article]
    N --> B[Audit metadata: prediction, score, model ID]
    D --> B
    H --> B
    B --> RPC[Python JSON-RPC]
    RPC --> MC[MultiChain stream: news_records]
    MC --> T[Transaction ID and confirmations]
    MC --> V[Retrieve on-chain hashes]
    L --> V
    V --> I{Hashes match?}
    I -->|Yes| OK[Integrity verified; truth NOT established]
    I -->|No| BAD[Changed local content detected]
